            0.387,
            0.886,
            0.447
          ],
          "content": "\\*25. Fig. 6.53 shows two circles passing through each other’s centres. Find the area of the region enclosed by the two circles in terms of the common radius r."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
