            0.456,
            0.487,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": "\\*26. In Fig. 6.54, we see three triangles within a rectangle. The areas of the triangles are A, B, C, as marked. Show that the area of the rectangle is"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.211,
            0.565,
            0.381,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": "\\frac{2(A + C)(B + C)}{C}",
          "image_source": "images/page_35_equation_9.jpg"
        },
